<mjml>
  <mj-head><mj-title>Chat processing failed</mj-title></mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-section><mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="24px">A chat failed on {{ environment }}</mj-text>
      <mj-text>The backend could not finish processing a chat request.</mj-text>
      <mj-text>Stage: {{ stage }}<br />Failure category: {{ category }}<br />Deployed revision: {{ revision }}</mj-text>
      <mj-text>Today's detected failures: {{ failures }}</mj-text>
      <mj-text>Each distinct terminal chat failure is emailed once. Duplicate handling of the same failed request does not send another email.</mj-text>
      <mj-text>Inspect the server's request traces and error logs for this stage and deployed revision. This email contains no chat content or user identifiers.</mj-text>
    </mj-column></mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
